'''Sayaka Miki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 290
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sayaka Miki
|name2 = Sayaka & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sayaka & Cat''' at Level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sayaka Miki's main strength is her high DPS. While her base 6K DPS is pretty average, her Strengthen boosts it to an astounding 9K. Her range is both a boon and a curse, but isn't useful in general. She can't outrange backliner enemies (such as [[Master A.]] and [[THE SLOTH]]) and generally stands at an unsafe range for most bosses. However she can stand inside certain enemies' blindspots. This makes her very useful against LD enemies like [[Dolphina]], who will be unable to hit her. Her survivability is hindered further by having only 2 KBs as well as knockback immunity, and her Strengthen ability only activates at 50% HP, which puts her at her final normal KB. While she does have Lethal Strike Survive and good range, she will immediately die the next time she is hit, rendering the bonus knockback useless against LD/Wave/Surge/Omni Strike enemies.

Overall, Sayaka Miki mostly works well in her role as a backliner but struggles on a handful of key stages.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

