==Trivia==
*Sayaka Miki was given [[Immune to Knockback|Knockback Immunity]] in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].
*On the information screen showing all the magical girls with short descriptions of their abilities, Sayaka Miki is incorrectly described as having "Large-scale area attacks with massive damage vs Angels". This is actually [[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Mami Tomoe]]'s ability, and the two of them share the exact same description.

